      "answer": "Our usual layout, for every client: save recon.csv in the same folder as the statement, with the header row date,amount,ledger_ref and then one row per statement line, in the statement's order. Copy date and amount exactly as the statement writes them. ledger_ref is the Voucher of the bank-book entry the line matches, or empty when none matches. A line matches an entry only when the amounts are equal and the description names the entry's party, and each entry matches at most one line.",
